OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of rain at first,     
OL,6,Fespecially across southern areas, will 
OL,7,Fgradually be replaced by dry but       
OL,8,Flargely cloudy conditions from the     
OL,9,Fnorth. Some late sunny spells may      
OL,10,Fdevelop, most likely across            
OL,11,FNorthumberland.                        
OL,13,CTonight:FMainly dry with clear         
OL,14,Fperiods, with scattered coastal        
OL,15,Fshowers arriving from the north later  
OL,16,Ftonight. Inland a widespread slight    
OL,17,Ffrost will develop, with a risk of ice 
OL,18,Fon untreated surfaces.                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
