OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CFriday:FFrosty start for many places,  
OL,6,Fwith a risk of ice on untreated        
OL,7,Fsurfaces. Then patchy cloud and sunny  
OL,8,Fspells, along with scattered coastal   
OL,9,Fshowers, a few potentially rather      
OL,10,Fheavy.                                 
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry    
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells, apart for possibly  
OL,14,Fisolated coastal showers Saturday and  
OL,15,Frain late Monday. Overnight frosts,    
OL,16,Fwith potentially patchy freezing mist  
OL,17,For fog. Generally rather cold.         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
